C9's Mango desktop combines the compositor, Rio, Waybar, Fuzzel, Mako,
Swaybg, fonts, clipboard and XDG tools, desktop portals, seat management,
and an SDDM login screen. Regular C9 packages own the session defaults,
artwork, and explicit system setup utility.

This dependency-only port does not enable services or modify user files.
The installer applies the selected hardware profile and initializes users.
Desktop access requires authentication; automatic login is not configured.
